<title>PAKISTAN: SQUASH-WORLD OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-WORLD OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of semifinals at the men's World Open squash championship on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat 4-Peter Nicol (Scotland)  15-9 15-9 15-8</p>
<p>2-Rodney Eyles (Australia) beat 5-Chris Walker (England) 15-12 15-7 14-15 4-15 15-14.</p>
</text>
